-- Fixed build:
--   * Preset list scrolls properly (AutomaticCanvasSize)
--   * Leg snapshots reset on respawn (no stale mesh IDs on a new body)
--   * Asset ID input is sanitized (full URLs accepted)
--   * Presets render in stable alphabetical order
--   * Toggle tween is guarded against rapid P / X spam
--   * No deprecated two-arg Instance.new calls
--   * Hide animation is slide-only (children no longer float opaque)
--   * Black & white glass theme (translucent panels, monochrome accents)
-- NEW FEATURES:
--   * CLONE tab — click any player to copy their entire outfit locally
--     (accessories, shirt, pants). Client-side only, fits the larp theme.
--   * KORBLOX tab also holds the Headless + Korblox (R6) pack toggles with
--     originals saved for clean reset; state survives respawn and re-applies.
--   * EQUIP tab has a REMOVE HAIR toggle — detaches hair accessories
